    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūpa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puppa</span></b> ), ae, f.
